 655:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  * @brief   Clears the USARTx's pending flags.
 656:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *
 657:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  * @param   USARTx - where x can be (1~8) to select the USART peripheral.
 658:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *          USART_FLAG - specifies the flag to clear.
 659:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            USART_FLAG_LBD - LIN Break detection flag.
 660:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            USART_FLAG_TC - Transmission Complete flag.
 661:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            USART_FLAG_RXNE - Receive data register not empty flag.
 662:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *          Note-
 663:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            - PE (Parity error), FE (Framing error), NE (Noise error), ORE (OverRun 
 664:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            error),  MS_ER(Mask or Space Parity Error) 
 665:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *              and IDLE (Idle line detected) pending bits are cleared by 
 666:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            software sequence: a read operation to USART_STATR register (USART_GetFlagStatus()) 
 667:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            followed by a read operation to USART_DATAR register (USART_ReceiveData()).
