 754:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            USART_IT_TC - Transmission complete interrupt.
 755:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            USART_IT_RXNE - Receive Data register not empty interrupt.
 756:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *         Note-
 757:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            - PE (Parity error), FE (Framing error), NE (Noise error), ORE (OverRun 
 758:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            error),  MS_ER(Mask or Space Parity Error) 
 759:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *              and IDLE (Idle line detected) pending bits are cleared by 
 760:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            software sequence: a read operation to USART_STATR register 
 761:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            (USART_GetITStatus()) followed by a read operation to USART_DATAR register 
 762:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            (USART_ReceiveData()).
 763:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            - RXNE pending bit can be also cleared by a read to the USART_DATAR register 
 764:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            (USART_ReceiveData()).
 765:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            - TC pending bit can be also cleared by software sequence: a read 
 766:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            operation to USART_STATR register (USART_GetITStatus()) followed by a write 
 767:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            operation to USART_DATAR register (USART_SendData()).
 768:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_usart.c ****  *            - TXE pending bit is cleared only by a write to the USART_DATAR register 
